      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-26T14:19:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<blockquote><p><span>Seriously, become a playtester.</span></p></blockquote><p><span>I can't. :( &nbsp;I have a philosophical problem with the idea of paying someone for the privelege of testing their product for them. &nbsp;Sadly, that's always seemed like the kind of thing they should be paying for, not the other way around. &nbsp;I keep hoping that my contributions to the SotM community will add up to at least $40 in &gt;G's minds and they'll comp me a playtester slot, but that doesn't seem to be in the cards, so I remain on the outside, being a pain in everyone's arse, looking in. :)</span></p>",
